                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Ray's The Dead is a game of hope.\n\"I hope Someone will make another game about playing as a zombie after Stubbs the zombie\" YEP\n\"I hope the game will be released less than 6 years after the kick-starter finishes.\" NOPE\n\"I hope it is exactly what they promised in said kick-starter\" YEP\n\"I hope it is possible to beat the bullfight boss without having to collect +90% of the \"optional\" upgrades til' now.\" NOPE\n\"I hope the story is rich, emotional, and funny all at once\" YEP\n\"I hope there isn't another game breaking glitch.\" NOPE\n\"I hope there is gameplay variety to keep the game from getting stale\" YEP\n\"I hope this timed puzzle doesn't require superhuman luck, speed, and sub-pixel perfect movement.\" NOPE\n\"I hope the ending is satisfying\" YEP\n\"I hope the developers listen to the community and work on these bugs\" So far so good\n\nT.L.D.R.\nOverall good game, wait for updates, will update review if things change\n",
